{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/37pkyik7q71b6drx80c8n6snj95rcym.mp3","text":"打扰了，博士，今天是我值班......嗯？哎，我的刀，怎么卡在门框上了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/ei8mt8bitazdxpu3oznbxh4u9ywbr0s.mp3","text":"在我家乡，土壤一天比一天贫瘠，收的那点粮食连自己都喂不饱，大多数人无法谋生，只好做佣兵，只要给钱，什么都做。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/goe375mlluuiopi4do7ex9xbprpise1.mp3","text":"呃，他们说我的刀太危险，禁止我再进厨房。我只是想帮忙，可是，那个砧板，我的刀稍微一碰就裂开了......唉，那个，要赔偿吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/ellnvrofrhz8e6zjgq6kabj3wrhvr0p.mp3","text":"每次晒着太阳，都会忍不住犯困。你放心，在确认安全之前，我不会真的...睡着......的.........ZZZzzzzz............","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/29/3onpoiy4jqduvzo8ue3qnwngb4ptatl.mp3","text":"在工作上，我有自己的原则，我不伤害无辜，也不让无关的人承受损失。......说实话，这好难。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/15p3p3ejdaea86g4bo1cm29mgg6hvew.mp3","text":"这条项链，借你用，要收好，这是守护符。不行，刀不能给你，我不在的时候，就用这个将就一下吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/ne7zx8763cmkj0qa0zm85f0g0v0gncm.mp3","text":"博士，你看着我的眼睛别动，哎，你别动......嗯，嗯嗯，放心了，你不是那种利用他人作恶的人，我看得出来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/80/ica0x49oijfaisge520xewggcqt01yh.mp3","text":"小时候的事，其实我不太记得了，是老师抚养我长大，还教我如何用刀。老师告诉我，我父母无辜被牵连，死在一场争斗中，他捡到我时我就抱着这把刀，就算被割伤也不松开。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/47/9s9bhiugzljdh0uj6xwy24hdb7r054m.mp3","text":"持刀的人总会追寻一场对决，而夺人性命的人，最终也将成为他人手中亡魂。或许有一天，我也会迎来这样的结局......到时候，希望你能见证。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/62/k3xgyy44tpu9ddlysrqibwpqnhp0ziw.mp3","text":"有我守着，安心睡吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/5vjbhwzkfbvi4z2wsiow3z5l0njgxzy.mp3","text":"刻刀，只是个普通的雇佣兵。我得了矿石病，所以打算用我的能力换取治疗机会，这把刀应该还能派上些用场......嗯，就是这样。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/d1omme0u5aza3xulpcz1uljkp9aiwjn.mp3","text":"好厉害！原来还有这种用刀的方法！","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/ry80k8oeh85ijowgiqsrwrpgwzs491r.mp3","text":"除了刀，自由就是我唯一的宝物，如果你愿意保障它，我就都听你的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/q1pxrc5j8gbtqvrbxsqjddzzyep1adt.mp3","text":"佣兵的刀，不是那种没见过血，服服帖帖的小玩具。或许也会有一天，我将无法再控制我的刀。不过，不用担心，至少现在......它会为你所用。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:5/57/1rdpzvj12targp1zxxch21pak3q4ut8.mp3","text":"了解。刻刀入队了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/0g1ohiwqa3gwsz1jn6o3xpbkcj69cut.mp3","text":"明白，我可以挑选自己的队员吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/l4maomvf8vu7pkqs27acfipqhl9jx1x.mp3","text":"准备好，注意不要波及无辜人员。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/a4v83coy6s46u3c6erci3xtmfin0jum.mp3","text":"刀子，擦亮了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/ngydwtm2hat5wobolkms1bbgt96qiiu.mp3","text":"明白了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/n71s06weyptv8uhh47v362hdj8obuaq.mp3","text":"我可以等待。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/l1e4v48a9d0eg0wrp7ttfqfrdbst2sx.mp3","text":"战场就是坟场。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/dtnk2mheskmliczrkghrdfvtz1r2nqv.mp3","text":"我要做的只是挥刀而已。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:5/53/0w5pthm3ji74pe1d7215ij8fyr4yyaw.mp3","text":"别出声。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/gungi52bzlkon3hbjffgmoeewc3m3ge.mp3","text":"别回头。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/pbqvtomkpts9a76vpdn6xl9nu61w21m.mp3","text":"直视我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/imho42dyg6gt0tzpfxzneijxlzmc5tt.mp3","text":"你慢了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/ag7tc2q8bskxfo43wyx0go757yx6whq.mp3","text":"或许总有一天，会出现我的刀斩不断的东西。但，看来不是现在，不是你们。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/nc0b5glc69hz35pslbc4o5rx3hsrqod.mp3","text":"呼......按照合同完成了，需要清点一下吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/61/q00wbphrd9ladvh8yjcf88gyv86puq9.mp3","text":"失去战意的人，不该是我的攻击目标。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:6/64/7s07tsi71ao3tpmemc5r0avm2in9y79.mp3","text":"走，博士，尽可能地走远！这里......还有我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/5r8k4q3ezcsq7e0d9dwxdl24hw4040h.mp3","text":"可以晒到太阳，嗯，暖暖的......","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:9/91/93y0pl01t6okjl0qpgaggn8aigb89op.mp3","text":"唔，别拉耳朵。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/9ax3xxwwhcnuxo6yu2t16gad1oeacag.mp3","text":"要一起晒太阳吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/nk233suit1vqg9i8xwtts8sk8oysary.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/b5x2hkw3a1fnarn45mivh000zdmmdxb.mp3","text":"新的一年，希望你健康。嗯，要好好过每一天，还要多多晒太阳，总之，在我力所能及的范围内，我会继续关注你的。新年快乐，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/l8qese9rkvnbf34vcjel3ttil90c2f8.mp3","text":"啊，博士你来了。今天有哪些工作？","alt":"voice_cn/char_301_cutter/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/2ljgkpd5nsguamenbaemy3e4vhav28o.mp3","text":"打扰了，博士，今天是我值班......嗯？哎，我的刀，怎么卡在门框上了......","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/mmm2dvmzu0sikuil2kcn4ha2e47af9i.mp3","text":"在我家乡，土壤一天比一天贫瘠，收的那点粮食连自己都喂不饱，大多数人无法谋生，只好做佣兵，只要给钱，什么都做。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/29/fazabjgide497bb6cdqyr38wcn4wdwa.mp3","text":"呃，他们说我的刀太危险，禁止我再进厨房。我只是想帮忙，可是，那个砧板，我的刀稍微一碰就裂开了......唉，那个，要赔偿吗？","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/05z04yylrh5ysr1i3nxdy7effmcdhq3.mp3","text":"每次晒着太阳，都会忍不住犯困。你放心，在确认安全之前，我不会真的...睡着......的.........ZZZzzzzz............","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/q8os4smvm2kg32k6f4lgnwo8jg4bg62.mp3","text":"在工作上，我有自己的原则，我不伤害无辜，也不让无关的人承受损失。......说实话，这好难。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/pu58vaxoz86c8cvecysjau8zdx8gdwt.mp3","text":"这条项链，借你用，要收好，这是守护符。不行，刀不能给你，我不在的时候，就用这个将就一下吧。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/93f7xp1o6qbbsrvwpqgdiasb2kapp2q.mp3","text":"博士，你看着我的眼睛别动，哎，你别动......嗯，嗯嗯，放心了，你不是那种利用他人作恶的人，我看得出来。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/kucwc8xxh0eth4mmsuab9nbrlg5w9s5.mp3","text":"小时候的事，其实我不太记得了，是老师抚养我长大，还教我如何用刀。老师告诉我，我父母无辜被牵连，死在一场争斗中，他捡到我时我就抱着这把刀，就算被割伤也不松开。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/c8w6br87anbp1yowgql1hcem8rl6l8m.mp3","text":"持刀的人总会追寻一场对决，而夺人性命的人，最终也将成为他人手中亡魂。或许有一天，我也会迎来这样的结局......到时候，希望你能见证。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/267eftpqzv1qyn6phqwzm0brtr6elze.mp3","text":"有我守着，安心睡吧。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:0/09/4fkbk9z5jzdm98bhjngg2kk53fx3q1o.mp3","text":"刻刀，只是个普通的雇佣兵。我得了矿石病，所以打算用我的能力换取治疗机会，这把刀应该还能派上些用场......嗯，就是这样。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/65/m33nrw3rcm3h38t9pvu6zpotdh9rda8.mp3","text":"好厉害！原来还有这种用刀的方法！","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/rebikoetyhlap493cxme9bclqteg8v6.mp3","text":"除了刀，自由就是我唯一的宝物，如果你愿意保障它，我就都听你的。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/kaw9vk3vd8qd3ilmivi9ng7y05yx2lo.mp3","text":"佣兵的刀，不是那种没见过血，服服帖帖的小玩具。或许也会有一天，我将无法再控制我的刀。不过，不用担心，至少现在......它会为你所用。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/qbnml8j0s7p9vbldiabs8xazqa1tc7j.mp3","text":"了解。刻刀入队了。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/egxp04vd8j9w1wwzsyxelwjhwyma4ow.mp3","text":"明白，我可以挑选自己的队员吗？","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:4/47/ggh4xjsms7h18xbe2bxxyyr2gz6u41s.mp3","text":"准备好，注意不要波及无辜人员。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:4/41/53asshaj42ofnwuajf51w40o0ufeazz.mp3","text":"刀子，擦亮了吗？","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/m3bzptr4el38cfq7kr4sy176ltcvrnz.mp3","text":"明白了。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/6rkt9us4zuw8dmacm4yk2i735ugizt1.mp3","text":"我可以等待。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/mohsk99n9sv8oiew211ta592vh0qqle.mp3","text":"战场就是坟场。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/9sac6hbxe0v37b7a8dkcvtg7shh3me4.mp3","text":"我要做的只是挥刀而已。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/idsocaidryxh8cfc078r4o5a5mjfw5z.mp3","text":"别出声。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/ku4red7g3i3ymjf9yqdw4qi265jpzs2.mp3","text":"别回头。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/bgqb9o5fumz3pkvkpuc0b6ipjqilmjb.mp3","text":"直视我。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/02/om3d8v1rpvuinxoq5vhf67wccc1en9d.mp3","text":"你慢了。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/ptomt3sfe35b353n159u5kxe44bdolg.mp3","text":"或许总有一天，会出现我的刀斩不断的东西。但，看来不是现在，不是你们。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/foa56me79pgvvpqcakxah5xfffbyz6k.mp3","text":"呼......按照合同完成了，需要清点一下吗？","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/t84aa211uddwzo2tspwxj0kp42cx6oi.mp3","text":"失去战意的人，不该是我的攻击目标。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/sipu2gnifxflcnk5yyazlj6aukpeink.mp3","text":"走，博士，尽可能地走远！这里......还有我。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/pf8lecuhqrwd0gos6vx7asrumgzng9s.mp3","text":"可以晒到太阳，嗯，暖暖的......","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:8/82/p2ewd1x1vnm6zy8hxuey5o669uf0ftp.mp3","text":"唔，别拉耳朵。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/akzd506goa3qqsm7nevozmsd37i5cyl.mp3","text":"要一起晒太阳吗？","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:2/21/jevauhefoxf54y29xo5h29psw5jja4e.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/q83y06fp75qvbnx64q2zlqco6ooblr1.mp3","text":"新的一年，希望你健康。嗯，要好好过每一天，还要多多晒太阳，总之，在我力所能及的范围内，我会继续关注你的。新年快乐，博士。","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/4pk0h7rp4ueaj2bgym606t1s6lg6666.mp3","text":"啊，博士你来了。今天有哪些工作？","alt":"voice/char_301_cutter/cn_042.mp3"}]}}